1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:01,928
- 进来吧 - 嘿哟
- Come on in. - Hey-o!

2
00:00:01,953 --> 00:00:03,373
- 嗨 - 哈喽
- Hi! - Hello.

3
00:00:03,398 --> 00:00:05,452
喜欢我们的毛衣吗
Do you love our sweaters?

4
00:00:05,477 --> 00:00:07,803
我觉得雪球舞会穿这个一定超赞
I thought they would be perfect for the Snow Ball dance.

5
00:00:07,828 --> 00:00:09,494
就是在卖圣诞饰品
I got them at the store where you buy things

6
00:00:09,563 --> 00:00:10,796
的那种店里买的
that go with the other things.

7
00:00:10,864 --> 00:00:12,364
噢我知道那里 我们就是在那家店买的那个
Oh, I know that place. That's where we got

8
00:00:12,433 --> 00:00:14,514
画着椒盐乐队的胡椒和盐调料罐
our Salt-N-Pepa salt and pepper shakers.

9
00:00:14,539 --> 00:00:17,272
克莱尔永远分不清乐队里谁是谁
Claire can never tell which one is which.

10
00:00:17,297 --> 00:00:20,069
这是个不太好解决的困惑
A confusing idea poorly executed.

11
00:00:20,138 --> 00:00:21,274
别再拐着弯说我种族歧视了
Stop implying I'm a racist.

12
00:00:21,299 --> 00:00:23,936
我们是怎么被骗去当陪护人这种事的
How did we get roped into this chaperone thing?

13
00:00:23,961 --> 00:00:26,765
都是这个无敌烦人的家庭教师协会成员 玛乔丽
This incredibly annoying PTA mom, Marjorie,

14
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:28,552
一直吵着要我们做一些志愿活动
keeps hounding us to volunteer for things,

15
00:00:28,577 --> 00:00:30,366
我们能用的借口都用完了
and we finally ran out of excuses.

16
00:00:30,391 --> 00:00:32,128
噢 我应该告诉她我们在路上了
Ooh, I should probably tell her we're coming.

17
00:00:33,244 --> 00:00:34,262
难以置信
Unreal.

18
00:00:34,287 --> 00:00:35,342
你到哪了
"Where are you?"

19
00:00:35,367 --> 00:00:36,616
你和克莱尔在一起吗
"Are you with Claire?"

20
00:00:36,641 --> 00:00:38,107
你们还有多远到
"How far away are you?"

21
00:00:38,132 --> 00:00:40,155
快到的时候给我发短信
"Text me when you're close."

22
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:42,420
我把车钥匙锁车里了
"I locked my keys in my car."

23
00:00:42,445 --> 00:00:43,892
噢 这是海莉发的
Oh, that's from Haley.

24
00:00:43,917 --> 00:00:45,569
虽然我很愿意帮忙促成这个活动
Much as I'd love to meet this dingbat,

25
00:00:45,594 --> 00:00:47,686
他们到底需要几个监护人啊
how many chaperones do they really need?

26
00:00:47,788 --> 00:00:51,006
要淋湿那些死胖子的话 一个人就够了吧
Takes one person to turn a garden hose on those dry humpers.

27
00:00:51,031 --> 00:00:52,864
如果菲尔去的话 你也得去
If Phil is going, you are going.

28
00:00:52,889 --> 00:00:56,317
我才不想变成在场唯一一个没带老公的人
I don't like being the only person in the room without a husband.

29
00:00:56,342 --> 00:00:57,944
没安全感
It's my one insecurity.

30
00:00:57,969 --> 00:00:59,331
菲尔只是想表示友好
Phil's just trying to be nice.

31
00:00:59,356 --> 00:01:00,799
他其实也不想去这种活动
He doesn't want to go to this thing, either.

32
00:01:00,824 --> 00:01:02,303
其实 我还挺期待的
Actually, I was looking forward to it.

33
00:01:02,328 --> 00:01:04,513
也许还可以见到那些所谓的啦啦队员
Maybe meet some of these so-called cheerleaders.

34
00:01:04,538 --> 00:01:06,838
要是我们告诉他们 咱们能空手把人在空中翻个转
Watch their faces when I tell them we could kewpie a scorpion

35
00:01:06,863 --> 00:01:09,718
接着立马分成几列站好 看他们什么表情
into a cradle catch and then pop up into a split extension.

36
00:01:09,743 --> 00:01:11,877
那些事很多现在都是违法的
Most of that stuff's illegal now.

37
00:01:11,902 --> 00:01:14,279
我觉得菲尔其实是想说
I think what Phil's trying to say is that

38
00:01:14,304 --> 00:01:17,600
我们俩已经很久没有过一个男人之夜了
he and I haven't had a boy's night in a good while.

39
00:01:17,625 --> 00:01:19,751
我的意思是 我们就一起消遣不也挺好
I mean, wouldn't it be nice to just hang out together,

40
00:01:19,776 --> 00:01:21,092
就你和我
just you and me?

41
00:01:21,116 --> 00:01:22,756
哥们 你觉得怎么样
What do you say, buddy?

42
00:01:23,543 --> 00:01:25,358
纳尼
What?!

43
00:01:26,288 --> 00:01:29,638
和我哥们杰一起玩玩儿也挺不错
Might be nice to have a hang with my boy Jay.

44
00:01:29,663 --> 00:01:31,296
如果你不介意的话
If it's fine with you.

45
00:01:31,321 --> 00:01:33,298
当然 我也只能帮你到这了
Sure, it's the least I could do, because tomorrow

46
00:01:33,323 --> 00:01:35,500
因为明天是你得陪卢克写作业
you are going to help Luke with his homework

47
00:01:35,525 --> 00:01:37,303
而我就去游览酒之城
while I visit wine country.

48
00:01:37,328 --> 00:01:38,814
我也想去
I want to go.

49
00:01:38,839 --> 00:01:39,866
她指的是
That's just what she calls

50
00:01:39,867 --> 00:01:41,606
躺在蹦床上喝夏敦埃酒
lying on the trampoline drinking Chardonnay.

51
00:01:41,631 --> 00:01:42,631
呃
Ah.

52
00:01:42,656 --> 00:01:44,509
噢 是的 我们在路上了
Oh, yes! We're on our way.

53
00:01:44,534 --> 00:01:45,575
- 好了 - 拜拜
- Okay. - Bye-bye.

54
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,878
- 拜拜 - 你俩好好玩儿啊
- Bye. - Have fun, you two.

55
00:01:46,911 --> 00:01:48,739
不用担心 我们会玩的很嗨的
Don't worry about us. We'll have a blast.

56
00:01:48,772 --> 00:01:50,215
我们会很开心的 我们会很开心的
We'll have a good time. We'll have a good time.

57
00:01:50,284 --> 00:01:52,017
耶
Yes!

58
00:01:52,086 --> 00:01:54,252
今晚一定超赞的
This is gonna be so great!

59
00:01:54,277 --> 00:01:55,520
当然了 等她们离开
Sure it will. Maybe give them about

60
00:01:55,545 --> 00:01:58,270
大概5分钟 你就可以走人了
a five-minute lag time before you hit the road.

61
00:01:58,539 --> 00:01:59,702
什么意思 你
What do you mean? You...

62
00:01:59,727 --> 00:02:01,213
你之前说我们要一起做点啥的
you said we were gonna do something together.

63
00:02:01,238 --> 00:02:03,641
我只是想帮我俩摆脱掉那场愚蠢的舞会
I was just trying to get us out of that stupid dance.

64
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,961
噢
Oh.

65
00:02:05,556 --> 00:02:07,430
- 好吧 - 好好享受今晚吧 菲尔
- Okay. - Enjoy your night, Phil.

66
00:02:07,455 --> 00:02:10,040
我要看一本史诗西部小说 讲的是一个恶警长
I've got a date with an epic Western about a crooked sheriff,

67
00:02:10,328 --> 00:02:11,472
我现在正看到
and I'm at the first of

68
00:02:11,473 --> 00:02:13,663
第一场绞刑呢 估计后面还得吊死好多个人
what I predict to be many wrongful hangings.

69
00:02:13,688 --> 00:02:15,522
好吧 既然你啥也不想干
Well, if you're not up for doing anything,

70
00:02:15,547 --> 00:02:17,095
那我就去舞会了
I think I'll just go to the dance.

71
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,869
什么 不行 你不能去
What? No. You can't do that.

72
00:02:18,894 --> 00:02:20,330
那我看起来不就跟混球一样了吗
Makes me look like a jerk.

73
00:02:20,355 --> 00:02:22,272
- 好吧 那我该干啥呢 - 随便你
- Well, then what am I supposed to do? - Whatever you like.

74
00:02:22,297 --> 00:02:24,645
- 我想去舞会 - 你怎么就没听懂呢
- I want to go to the dance. - How are you not getting this?

75
00:02:24,670 --> 00:02:27,099
好 那我就回家去
Fine. I'll just go home.

76
00:02:27,531 --> 00:02:28,653
你是去舞会 对吧
You're going to the dance, aren't you?

77
00:02:28,678 --> 00:02:31,101
- 当然啦 - 好吧 你赢了
- Of course I am. - All right, you win.

78
00:02:31,453 --> 00:02:33,342
- 我们来玩吧 - 棒棒哒
- We'll do something. - Awesome!

79
00:02:33,414 --> 00:02:35,054
- 你想做什么 - 我的天 我不知道
- What do you want to do? - Gosh, I don't know.

80
00:02:35,079 --> 00:02:36,995
我是说 我还想着跳舞呢
I mean, dancing is still so much in the air.

81
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,707
- 啊啊 - 你去哪啊
- Uh-huh - Where are you going?

82
00:02:38,732 --> 00:02:39,937
苏格兰酒城玩玩吧
Scotch country.

83
00:02:52,922 --> 00:02:54,720
12号桶里冰块不够了
We're low on ice in bucket 12.

84
00:02:55,516 --> 00:02:57,385
嘿 嘿 这些蟹饼得撑一晚上
Hey, hey, those crab cakes have to last all night.

85
00:02:57,410 --> 00:02:58,843
少发点儿 出去躲躲
Push the cheese.

86
00:02:59,985 --> 00:03:01,094
演出曲目呢
Setlist?

87
00:03:02,422 --> 00:03:03,558
你要以Get Lucky开场
You're starting with "Get Lucky"?

88
00:03:03,583 --> 00:03:05,664
搞毛啊你他妈
Come on, we're telling a story here.

89
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:08,826
你知道现在几点了吗
Do you know what time it is?

90
00:03:08,851 --> 00:03:10,015
我还以为你会帮我布置
I thought you were gonna help me set up.

91
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,945
抱歉啦兄弟 我在烦这幅大图的事
Sorry, buddy. I was worrying about the big-picture stuff.

92
00:03:13,094 --> 00:03:15,272
嗯这里有地方放吗
Hmm. Is there enough room for it here,

93
00:03:15,297 --> 00:03:17,045
还是我应该把它放在后门啊
or should I put it in the back entrance?

94
00:03:17,070 --> 00:03:19,422
呵呵 你这张图确实够格放后门
You can certainly put it in a back entrance.

95
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:23,138
噢 我的天呐 一切都布置得这么漂亮
Oh, my gosh, doesn't everything look so lovely?

96
00:03:23,163 --> 00:03:24,295
毕竟是高中
Well, it's high school.

97
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:26,131
不管怎么装饰 这里还是
Dress it up all you want, it's still the place I spent

98
00:03:26,156 --> 00:03:28,740
我被残酷的欺凌折磨了四年的地方
four years being tormented by sadistic bullies.

99
00:03:28,765 --> 00:03:30,484
衬衫不错 米歇尔
Nice shirt, Michelle.

100
00:03:30,509 --> 00:03:32,652
噢你知道吗 时代已经变了
Oh, you know what? Times have changed.

101
00:03:32,677 --> 00:03:34,513
高中的时候 你有想过
In high school, did you ever imagine

102
00:03:34,538 --> 00:03:36,415
自己会和足球教练在一起吗
you'd end up with the football coach?

103
00:03:36,517 --> 00:03:38,050
足球教练吗 噢没有
The football coach? No.

104
00:03:38,075 --> 00:03:40,522
游泳教练阿蒂诺倒是每晚都想
The swim coach, Mr. Artino, almost nightly.

105
00:03:40,547 --> 00:03:42,865
噢 塔克教练 米切尔
Oh, Coach Tucker, Mitchell.

106
00:03:42,937 --> 00:03:44,111
感谢你们来做志愿者
Thank you for volunteering.

107
00:03:44,136 --> 00:03:45,168
我可拒绝不了啊
I couldn't say no.

108
00:03:45,193 --> 00:03:46,992
队里的孩子都快求着我来了
The kids on the team practically begged me.

109
00:03:47,028 --> 00:03:50,650
能成为这么重要的人 影响这么多孩子 实在太令人感动了
It's an amazing thing to matter so much and inspire so many.

110
00:03:50,675 --> 00:03:52,675
噢不 我觉得他们想要你来是因为
Oh, no, I think they just wanted you here

111
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:53,750
那样他们就能恶搞你了
so they can prank you.

112
00:03:53,801 --> 00:03:54,967
- 嗯 - 是啊
- Hmm? - Yeah.

113
00:03:54,992 --> 00:03:56,772
足球队内部已经准备了一些计划
The football team has something all worked out.

114
00:03:56,797 --> 00:03:58,365
我也不清楚到底是什么 因为
I don't know what it is 'cause I checked out

115
00:03:58,390 --> 00:03:59,928
上次他们停发我薪水 我就没来
after they capped my salary.

116
00:03:59,953 --> 00:04:01,709
但是一般都会搞得乱七八糟的
But there's usually a mess,

117
00:04:01,734 --> 00:04:04,303
你可能会想用一件斗篷遮住那华丽丽的场景
so you might want to throw a poncho over all that finery.

118
00:04:04,328 --> 00:04:06,889
噢 噢 我的天 我太讨厌恶作剧了
Oh. Oh, my God, I hate pranks so much.

119
00:04:06,914 --> 00:04:09,373
现在好了 我会整晚疑神疑鬼
Now I'm gonna spend the whole dance paranoid

120
00:04:09,398 --> 00:04:10,660
想象他们会怎么整我
wondering what they're gonna do.

121
00:04:10,685 --> 00:04:11,928
会不会痛 我会不会被弄哭啊
Is it gonna hurt? Am I gonna cry?

122
00:04:11,953 --> 00:04:13,319
你就是小丑啊
You're a clown.

123
00:04:13,421 --> 00:04:15,164
小丑通常不就是恶搞别人吗
Isn't that mostly just pranking people?

124
00:04:15,189 --> 00:04:18,190
不 才不是 小丑是很有爱而且欢乐的
No, it is not. Clowns are loving and joyful.

125
00:04:18,259 --> 00:04:20,469
你知道吗 我曾经被警告过这类的无知行为
You know what? I was warned about this kind of ignorance.

126
00:04:20,494 --> 00:04:23,547
别让我后悔嫁出马戏团
Don't make me regret marrying outside the big top.

127
00:04:23,831 --> 00:04:25,187
怎么了
What?

128
00:04:28,073 --> 00:04:29,105
我们得盯紧点
We got to keep our eyes peeled

129
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:31,041
这些小孩们想带酒进来
for kids trying to bring alcohol in here.

130
00:04:31,066 --> 00:04:33,073
今晚不喝酒我会撑不过去的
I cannot make it through this thing without a drink.

131
00:04:33,098 --> 00:04:34,979
玛乔丽 12点方向
Marjorie, 12:00.

132
00:04:35,004 --> 00:04:36,303
噢天呐
Oh, God.

133
00:04:37,773 --> 00:04:38,872
快 假装我们在吵架
Quick, pretend we're having a fight.

134
00:04:38,897 --> 00:04:39,973
- 那她就不会过来了 - 嗯哼
- Then she won't come over here. - Mm-hmm.

135
00:04:39,998 --> 00:04:42,487
你抢了我的遗产 你这个傍大款的
You stole my inheritance, you gold digger!

136
00:04:42,512 --> 00:04:44,345
喔 你这话憋很久了吧
Wow, you had that one ready to go.

137
00:04:44,370 --> 00:04:45,669
你们在这啊
There you are.

138
00:04:45,694 --> 00:04:46,760
收到我的短信了吗
Did you get my texts?

139
00:04:46,785 --> 00:04:48,351
看我就没收了什么
Look what I've already confiscated.

140
00:04:48,376 --> 00:04:51,210
噢 龌龊无耻 我帮你没收了
Oh, shameful. I'll take that.

141
00:04:51,235 --> 00:04:53,917
我还需要志愿者去号召父母们
So, I still need volunteers to call parents

142
00:04:53,942 --> 00:04:55,542
来参加无声竞拍
for silent auction items.

143
00:04:55,567 --> 00:04:57,967
我已经分好了6小时的轮班制
I've divided it into six-hour shifts,

144
00:04:57,992 --> 00:05:00,471
所以如果每半小时换一只耳朵听的话
so if you switch ears every half-hour,

145
00:05:00,652 --> 00:05:02,051
其实也还好啦
it's actually not bad.

146
00:05:02,099 --> 00:05:04,099
我能算上你俩吗
Can I count on you two ladies?

147
00:05:04,124 --> 00:05:07,542
我没时间 但她就不一定了
I'm so busy, but I can't speak for Gloria.

148
00:05:07,675 --> 00:05:10,437
我英语很烂啦
My phone English no so good.

149
00:05:10,539 --> 00:05:12,925
好吧 我有点强人所难了
I get it. I'm a bit of a nag-eroo.

150
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,034
嗯嗯
Mm.

151
00:05:14,059 --> 00:05:15,592
就像我妈常开玩笑说
Like my mom always jokes,

152
00:05:15,617 --> 00:05:17,050
你知道谁会不厌其烦让你麻烦吗
you know who you should bore with this?

153
00:05:17,075 --> 00:05:19,475
你老公啊 噢 对了 他抛弃了你
Your husband. Oh, right, he left you.

154
00:05:24,383 --> 00:05:25,916
那女的好焦虑啊
That woman is so uptight.

155
00:05:25,941 --> 00:05:27,440
- 你知道她需要什么吗 - 嗯
- You know what she needs? - Mm.

156
00:05:27,465 --> 00:05:28,685
男人
A man.

157
00:05:28,710 --> 00:05:31,511
那是老一辈的思想了
That is a very old-fashioned attitude,

158
00:05:31,536 --> 00:05:34,160
不过在这件事上 好像确实如此
which in this case, seems pretty accurate.

159
00:05:34,185 --> 00:05:36,351
男人 男人 男人 上哪找啊
A man, a man, a man. Where can we find one.

160
00:05:36,376 --> 00:05:38,877
嗨咯 Siri 查找 古董巡回秀
Hey, Siri, record "Antiques Roadshow."

161
00:05:38,902 --> 00:05:40,401
想不到人啊
I can't think of anyone.

162
00:05:40,687 --> 00:05:42,142
布朗校长啊
Principal Brown.

163
00:05:42,167 --> 00:05:43,634
他也单身 我们可以撮合他们
He's single. We could fix them up.

164
00:05:43,659 --> 00:05:45,845
- 冬日舞会上耶 - 嗯哼
- At the Winter dance. - Mm-hmm.

165
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:47,181
好浪漫啊
That's so romantic.

166
00:05:47,206 --> 00:05:49,807
对啊 这样她就顾不上
Yes, and maybe she'll get off our backs

167
00:05:49,832 --> 00:05:52,050
跟我们唠叨不停啦
if she spends more time on hers.

168
00:05:52,075 --> 00:05:54,602
虎父无犬子哈
You really are your father's son.

169
00:06:00,745 --> 00:06:01,754
嘿 你还好吧
Hey, you okay?

170
00:06:01,779 --> 00:06:03,752
那家伙刚当着大家的面取笑我的蝶形领结
