我是大家的公仆 这一切都是我应该做的
I'm just a humble servant who made it all happen.

197
00:07:06,154 --> 00:07:08,288
能让我和他说两句嘛 谢谢
Can you excuse us, please? Thank you.

198
00:07:08,533 --> 00:07:09,880
你真不要脸
You are unbelievable.

199
00:07:09,905 --> 00:07:11,805
别 我都听你说了几遍了
Stop. I can't keep hearing this.

200
00:07:11,829 --> 00:07:13,629
这次派对的成功是我的功劳
I'm the one who made all this happen.

201
00:07:13,661 --> 00:07:17,252
