- 他说笑呢 - 问这干嘛 怎么了
- He's being sarcastic. - Why? What's wrong?

216
00:07:45,934 --> 00:07:48,101
没什么 只是在想要是钱花光了咋办
Nothing. Just playing "What if all the money got spent?"

217
00:07:48,126 --> 00:07:50,096
噢 你敢想象吗
Oh, can you imagine? -

218
00:07:50,121 --> 00:07:51,938
