因为我们也请不起校医了 对吧
'cause we can't afford a school nurse anymore, right?

223
00:08:00,772 --> 00:08:02,557
噢 有牡蛎哎
Ooh! Oysters.

224
00:08:05,991 --> 00:08:07,758
