more worried about this prank than you need to be.

240
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,600
我只是想不明白为什么他们会想捉弄我
Well, I just don't understand why they want to prank me.

241
00:08:42,625 --> 00:08:43,757
我原以为他们喜欢我来着
I thought they liked me.

242
