他们当然喜欢你啊
Of course they like you.

243
00:08:45,036 --> 00:08:46,631
怎么能捉弄一个你讨厌的人呢
You can't prank someone you don't like.

244
00:08:46,656 --> 00:08:48,389
那就是 那就是纯粹地恶意攻击了
That's... that's just assault.

245
00:08:48,602 --> 00:08:50,635
但是捉弄你只是他们表达爱你
But pranking you is their bizarre way

246
00:08:50,660 --> 00:08:51,859
的一种偏奇怪的方式罢了
of saying that they love you.

247
00:08:51,884 --> 00:08:55,202
那这算是你忽略我感受的古怪方式吗
Is this your bizarre way of not validating my feelings?

248
00:08:56,275 --> 00:08:57,832
那好吧 我们可以去打保龄球
Okay, we could go bowling.

249
00:08:57,900 --> 00:09:00,656
嗯 昨晚打过啦 现在不是很想打
Hmm. Had my league last night. I'm a little bowled out.

250
00:09:00,681 --> 00:09:02,178
好吧 那打局迷你高尔夫
Fair enough. Round of mini golf?

251
00:09:02,204 --> 00:09:04,678
好主意 等下 我是不是要带上我的青蛙和弹弓
Great idea. Wait up. I'll go get my frog and my slingshot.

252
00:09:04,702 --> 00:09:06,068
然后踩个脚踏车去玩儿啊
We'll hop on our bikes and go down there.

253
00:09:06,137 --> 00:09:07,846
- 那我们可以去吃点什么 - 已经吃过啦
- We could get something to eat. - Already ate.

254
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:09,515
- 看电影 - 讨厌看台词
- Go to the movies? - Hate the lines.

255
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:11,514
- 去酒吧怎样 - 那我们要开车大老远跑过去
- How about a bar? - So, we drive across town,

256
00:09:11,547 --> 00:09:13,921
付两倍的价买杯与我手上无异
pay a 200% markup on the same glass of scotch

257
00:09:13,946 --> 00:09:15,570
的苏格兰威士忌吗
I'm holding in my hand right now...

258
