I promise your next idea, I'll say yes to.

266
00:09:33,190 --> 00:09:35,344
- 有必要吗 - 谢啦 杰
- Really? - Thanks, Jay.

267
00:09:35,369 --> 00:09:36,845
你一直想做点什么酷酷的事
You held out for something awesome,

268
