一个小时前还免费呢
It was free an hour ago.

272
00:09:48,087 --> 00:09:49,387
你以前还可以把小孩丢
You used to be able to throw a baby

273
00:09:49,412 --> 00:09:50,761
后座 不用儿童安全座椅呢
in the back seat without strapping it in.

274
00:09:50,785 --> 00:09:52,015
朋友 时代变啦
Times change, my friend.

275
00:09:54,414 --> 00:09:55,713
嗨咯 （  ）
Hey, Delgado.

276
00:09:55,738 --> 00:09:57,805
希望这潘趣酒不像你上次在
I hope this punch isn't as watered down

277
00:09:57,830 --> 00:10:01,609
欲望号街车上吊自杀里的表演一样水
as your performance in "A Streetcar Named Desire to Hang Myself."

278
