You're lashing out.

287
00:10:20,871 --> 00:10:23,980
因为你很生气 没有安全感
Because you're angry and you're insecure,

288
00:10:24,005 --> 00:10:26,077
你就想让别人也尝尝你受的苦
and you just want everyone else to feel as bad as you do.

289
00:10:26,172 --> 00:10:27,505
也许吧
Maybe.

290
00:10:27,530 --> 00:10:29,340
拜托
But come on.

291
00:10:29,367 --> 00:10:32,472
你应该过得还不错吧 毕竟你长得像迈克尔 法斯宾德
It must've been easier for you looking like Michael Fassbender.

292
00:10:32,497 --> 00:10:34,798
我才不像
I do not look like...

293
00:10:34,823 --> 00:10:36,480
你觉得我像迈克尔 法斯宾德
You think I look like Michael Fassbender?

294
