恶作剧 噢 不是的
Prank? Oh, no.

312
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:14,050
可能我有点儿误会了
That was a little misunderstanding on my part.

313
00:11:14,075 --> 00:11:16,503
其实是他们要整的是那个新来的教练
Turns out the new wrestling coach is being pranked.

314
00:11:16,573 --> 00:11:17,853
对 他们会把他
Yeah, they're gonna do that thing where

315
00:11:17,878 --> 00:11:19,255
他转个好几圈
you spin a guy around a bunch of times,

316
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,285
然后当他晕圈的时候
you get him good and dizzy,

317
00:11:20,310 --> 00:11:22,354
把他绑在上树上 度过整个周末
and then you tie him to a tree for the weekend.

318
00:11:22,379 --> 00:11:23,705
噢 天呐 你都不阻止他们吗
Oh, God. Shouldn't you stop them?

319
00:11:23,773 --> 00:11:25,807
我也想啊 但他们最近老是在我的车位上停车
I would, but he's been parking in my spot lately.

320
00:11:26,184 --> 00:11:28,517
那这样的话他们就不会整我了
I guess it's a relief they're not pranking me.

321
00:11:28,586 --> 00:11:30,238
对啊 你终于可以放心了
Yes. You can finally relax.

322
00:11:30,263 --> 00:11:31,320
是吗
Can I?

323
