就在这个新来的才来了几个月之后
Knowing Coach Wilson's only been here seven months?

324
00:11:33,369 --> 00:11:35,211
还从来不给队员带自制的香蕉面包
He's never brought his team homemade banana loaf,

325
00:11:35,236 --> 00:11:37,148
他们就在乎他到想要整他了吗
and yet they care enough to terrorize him?

326
00:11:37,173 --> 00:11:39,099
好了 你是不是思想有问题啊
Okay, you're gonna have to land on a position.

327
00:11:39,124 --> 00:11:41,435
我只是不明白如果不是要整我的话
I just don't understand why they begged me to be here

328
00:11:41,537 --> 00:11:42,870
他们请我来干嘛
if they're not gonna prank me.

329
00:11:42,938 --> 00:11:44,605
因为他们敬爱你
Because they love you,

330
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:46,573
你真的改变了他们的人生
and you're making a real difference in their lives.

331
00:11:46,811 --> 00:11:48,021
噢 真是 我
Oh, well, I-I...

332
00:11:48,090 --> 00:11:49,956
我只是开玩笑的 因为他们觉得你好欺负
I'm just kidding. They think you're a pushover,

333
00:11:50,025 --> 00:11:51,458
而且你在这儿的话 他们就什么坏事儿就能干了
and with you here, they can get away with anything.

334
00:11:51,483 --> 00:11:53,424
这太不像话了 因为我 绝对不漏判任何一件坏事
That's ridiculous, because nothing gets past me.

335
00:11:53,449 --> 00:11:55,084
请来一杯 谢谢
Excuse me. Thank you.

336
00:11:55,137 --> 00:11:56,503
-嗯哼 -你在干嘛
- Mm-hmm. - What is that?

337
00:11:56,528 --> 00:11:57,593
看好了
Look at this.

338
00:11:57,618 --> 00:11:58,802
噢
Oh.

339
00:12:02,292 --> 00:12:04,459
我要把这些都倒进排水沟
I'm gonna go pour this down the drain.

340
00:12:04,648 --> 00:12:06,007
干杯
Cheers.

341
00:12:10,210 --> 00:12:11,454
玩得很开心哈
Having fun?

342
00:12:11,479 --> 00:12:13,929
