Hey, I'm just trying to keep up appearances.

343
00:12:13,954 --> 00:12:16,729
如果我慌了了 大家都慌了了
If I panic, everybody panics.

344
00:12:16,798 --> 00:12:18,384
你卖饮料买了多少钱
How much money did you make at the drink station?

345
00:12:18,409 --> 00:12:19,675
只卖了大概200美元
Only about $200.

346
00:12:19,700 --> 00:12:20,799
够了
That's enough.

347
00:12:21,036 --> 00:12:22,468
我一在乡村俱乐部的小跟班
A caddy at the country club where I work

348
00:12:22,493 --> 00:12:23,826
向我推荐了汉兹戴尔的赛狗场
knows this dog track in Hindsdale.

349
