好了 钱全赔了
Okay, the money's gone.

352
00:12:32,675 --> 00:12:33,674
就一次
One time.

353
00:12:33,699 --> 00:12:35,262
- 不 太逗比了 - 就试一次嘛
- No, it's stupid. - Just try it.

354
00:12:35,287 --> 00:12:37,044
- 士可杀不可辱 - 旁边又没人
- I'm not doing it. - No one else is around.

355
00:12:37,069 --> 00:12:39,137
-我不管 -拜托 我来起头
- I don't care. - Come on, I'll start.

356
00:12:39,605 --> 00:12:41,661
呜噫 呜噫 呜噫
A-weem-o-weh, a-weem-o-weh, a-weem-o-weh, a-weem-o-weh 

357
00:12:41,662 --> 00:12:43,541
呜噫 在那密密的丛林里
a-weem-o-weh, In the jungle 

358
