有人看上你啦
Somebody thinks you're cute.

360
00:12:58,583 --> 00:13:00,230
拜托克莱尔 这又不是在高中
Claire, please, this isn't high school.

361
00:13:00,333 --> 00:13:01,665
噢 不 等一下 这真的是在高中 
Well, no, wait a minute. It is high school.

362
00:13:01,734 --> 00:13:03,000
-哟 -好了
- Mm. - Okay.

363
00:13:03,025 --> 00:13:04,534
好吧 所以说到底是谁
All right, so who is it?

364
00:13:05,735 --> 00:13:09,137
我最爱的是一台1929年的烘焙箱
My favorite is a 1929 Bread Master.

365
00:13:09,162 --> 00:13:10,334
