收集老式烤箱是个无聊的爱好
that collecting vintage toasters is a crumby hobby.

367
00:13:15,745 --> 00:13:16,911
谢谢
Thank you.

368
00:13:16,936 --> 00:13:19,861
玛乔丽 我刚刚和布朗校长聊天
Marjorie, I was just talking to Principal Brown,

369
00:13:19,886 --> 00:13:21,653
他对你有意思哦 姑娘
and he into you, girl.

370
00:13:21,721 --> 00:13:25,056
真的吗 他可是比20世纪30年代的阳光烤炉还要火辣啊
Really? He's hotter than a 1930s Sunbeam Toastrite.

371
00:13:26,539 --> 00:13:28,306
-憋说话 
- Don't. 

372
00:13:28,495 --> 00:13:30,114
我现在不方便说话 妈妈
I can't talk right now, Mom.

373
00:13:30,139 --> 00:13:33,049
没有 这个周六我没有一个人在家
No, I'm not home alone on a Saturday night.

374
00:13:33,074 --> 00:13:36,512
我在一个舞会上 有个男孩子喜欢我哦
I'm at a dance, and a boy likes me.

375
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,587
我们真是牵线高手
We good at this!

376
00:13:38,689 --> 00:13:40,163
你为什要用这种腔调说话
Why are you talking like that?

377
00:13:40,188 --> 00:13:41,567
-我也不知道 -
- I don't know. -

378
00:13:41,592 --> 00:13:42,991
你们好 嗨 嘿
Excuse me, hi. Hey.

379
00:13:43,016 --> 00:13:45,187
我真不知道该怎么办才好
I don't know exactly how to do this,

380
00:13:45,212 --> 00:13:47,444
能被您垂青真是我的荣幸
but I'm very flattered by your interest in me,

381
00:13:47,469 --> 00:13:50,044
其实吧 我对你也有相同的感觉
and just so you know, the feeling is mutual.

382
00:13:50,069 --> 00:13:51,099
什么
What?

383
00:13:51,124 --> 00:13:53,078
不知道能否赏脸去露营 我有帐篷
I don't know if you're into camping, but I can get a tent.

384
00:13:53,341 --> 00:13:55,942
我是有夫之妇 另一边屁股还在家里呢
I'm married. My rear end is at home.

385
00:13:55,967 --> 00:13:57,596
我说的是 玛乔丽
I meant Marjorie.

386
00:13:57,934 --> 00:13:58,900
噢
Oh!

387
00:13:58,925 --> 00:14:01,391
噢 不不 她太过热情了
Oh, no. She's way too intense.

388
00:14:01,416 --> 00:14:03,471
不 而且每当你想到
No. And once you've imagined yourself

389
00:14:03,496 --> 00:14:05,893
自己坐在篝火旁 为歌洛迪娅吹着竖笛
sitting by a campfire playing your clarinet for Gloria...

390
00:14:05,918 --> 00:14:07,430
玛乔丽喜欢户外露营
Marjorie loves the outdoors.

391
00:14:07,455 --> 00:14:09,956
对啊 她连露营烤箱都有
Yes, she even has a camping toaster.

392
00:14:09,981 --> 00:14:13,937
她是个很不错的女性 但是 我才45岁
She is a super lady, but, guys, I'm only 45.

393
00:14:14,094 --> 00:14:16,204
我还憧憬者烟火浪漫夜呢
I'm holding out for fireworks.

394
00:14:16,229 --> 00:14:18,198
噢 恶魔来了
Oh, here comes Damien.

395
00:14:18,223 --> 00:14:21,458
千万不要告诉她我以为歌洛迪娅对我有意思
Do not tell him that I thought I had a shot with Gloria.

396
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:24,290
我妈妈不相信布朗校长喜欢我
My mom doesn't believe that Principal Brown likes me.

397
00:14:24,315 --> 00:14:25,354
你们能和她说吗
Can you tell her?

398
00:14:26,416 --> 00:14:27,760
歌洛迪娅
Gloria?

399
00:14:28,063 --> 00:14:30,497
我在电话里说的英语不太好
My phone English no so good.

400
00:14:32,484 --> 00:14:34,589
-去吃冰淇淋怎么样 -太冷了
- How about ice cream? - Too cold.

401
00:14:34,614 --> 00:14:35,668
- 咖啡 - 太晚了
- Coffee? - Too late.

402
00:14:35,693 --> 00:14:37,403
噢 等一下 我真是蠢
Oh, wait a minute. I'm such an idiot.

403
00:14:37,471 --> 00:14:39,038
我忘了还有克林特·伊斯特伍德的怀旧剧场
I forgot about the Clint Eastwood retrospective

404
00:14:39,106 --> 00:14:40,272
接着可以品尝苏格兰美酒
followed by the scotch tasting

405
00:14:40,341 --> 00:14:41,907
还有70年代的著名运动员和我们讲
where famous athletes from the '70s tell stories

406
00:14:41,976 --> 00:14:43,556
扬斯敦过去的故事
about how life used to be in Youngstown.

407
00:14:43,581 --> 00:14:44,654
- 真的吗 - 假的
- Really? - No!

408
00:14:44,937 --> 00:14:46,212
根本不可能
It doesn't exist.

409
00:14:46,237 --> 00:14:47,971
你想要的根本不可能有
What you want does not exist.

410
00:14:48,006 --> 00:14:49,539
你干嘛啊
What are you doing?

411
00:14:49,608 --> 00:14:51,228
我不管你想怎么样
I don't care what you do,

412
00:14:51,406 --> 00:14:52,829
但是我要去参加舞会
but I'm going into that dance.

413
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:54,874
我喜欢看孩子们盛装出席 假装自己是个大人
I like to see the kids all dressed up and happy

414
00:14:54,899 --> 00:14:56,740
