我的初吻就是在高中舞会上
The first girl I ever kissed was at a high school dance.

416
00:14:59,914 --> 00:15:01,155
噢
Huh.

417
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:03,179
那晚我真的唱了“狮王今夜眠”
It was actually to "The Lion Sleeps Tonight."

418
00:15:03,248 --> 00:15:04,874
这可能就是为什么这首歌一直在我脑中挥之不去吧
I guess that's why it was in my head.

419
00:15:04,899 --> 00:15:08,719
狮王那晚彻夜难眠
Let's just say the lion did not sleep that night.

420
00:15:09,523 --> 00:15:11,490
像个疯子一样往肚子里狂灌汽水儿
I was slamming Mountain Dews like a wild man.

421
00:15:11,515 --> 00:15:13,739
玛莎 古尔丁
Marsha Goulding.

422
00:15:13,764 --> 00:15:15,417
年轻时候疯狂迷恋她
I had this huge crush on her.

423
00:15:15,486 --> 00:15:18,348
最后鼓励勇气邀请她参加春节嘉年华
Finally got my nerve up to ask her to the Spring Fling.

424
00:15:18,373 --> 00:15:21,264
第一次跳舞 我很慌张 踩了她好几下
First dance, I was terrified. I'm tromping all over her feet.

425
00:15:21,289 --> 00:15:23,256
但是慢慢的 舞步越来越轻畅
But as the dances went on, it got easier,

426
00:15:23,324 --> 00:15:26,992
就在山姆 库克的 你如此真心 唱到一半的时候
and right in the middle of Sam Cooke singing "You Send Me,"

427
00:15:27,061 --> 00:15:28,660
我亲了她
I went for it.

428
00:15:29,125 --> 00:15:30,895
我很惊讶她也亲了我
I was just so surprised she kissed me back.

429
00:15:32,966 --> 00:15:35,934
好了 你的初吻再也不回来了
Well, you can't have your first kiss again,

430
00:15:35,969 --> 00:15:37,889
但是你的下一个吻在那儿
but you can have your next one right in there.

431
00:15:38,109 --> 00:15:39,465
噢 什么鬼 给歌洛迪娅一个惊喜（吓）
Oh, what the hell. Give Gloria a thrill.

432
00:15:39,534 --> 00:15:41,365
太好了 乔 因为你使她完整
That's great, Jay, 'cause you complete her.

433
00:15:43,843 --> 00:15:45,572
你使她完整了
You complete her.

434
00:15:47,093 --> 00:15:49,859
你是这个笑话的笑点
- You're the butt of this joke. 

435
00:15:50,095 --> 00:15:51,728
把毛衣给我
Give me the sweater.

436
