马乔里又聪明又有条理
Marjorie is smart and organized,

437
00:15:54,690 --> 00:15:56,517
如果你需要洗手液或创可贴
and if you ever need hand sanitizer or a Band-Aid,

438
00:15:56,542 --> 00:15:57,671
她都随身带的有
she always has it on her.

439
00:15:57,696 --> 00:16:00,396
她就是一个性感 火辣的便携式药房
She's like a sexy, sexy drugstore.

440
00:16:00,421 --> 00:16:01,890
她可爱极了
She's as cute as a button.

441
00:16:01,915 --> 00:16:04,123
像是成人版的大头娃娃
Like a grown-up Cabbage Patch doll.

442
00:16:04,148 --> 00:16:05,614
- 耶 - 耶 那看起来
- Yeah. - Yeah, that seems like

443
00:16:05,639 --> 00:16:07,177
会很有聊噢 
it'd be a whole lot of e-mails.

444
00:16:07,202 --> 00:16:08,301
这就很难办了
It's a hard pass.

445
00:16:08,326 --> 00:16:09,969
但是 布朗校长 你知道他们怎么说
But, Principal Brown, you know what they say

446
00:16:09,994 --> 00:16:12,782
一个热心家务事的母亲吗
about a mom who's enthusiastic in the streets.

447
00:16:12,807 --> 00:16:14,422
从来没有这种说法
That's not a saying.

448
00:16:14,447 --> 00:16:15,317
为什么你们两个
Why are the two of you

449
00:16:15,318 --> 00:16:17,176
突然关心起我的感情生活来了 
suddenly so interested in my love life, anyway?

450
00:16:17,201 --> 00:16:18,664
因为我们关心你啊
Because we care.

451
00:16:18,689 --> 00:16:19,979
你都不知道我的大名吧
You don't even know my first name.

452
00:16:20,081 --> 00:16:21,219
不 我们知道
Yes, we do.

453
00:16:21,244 --> 00:16:23,716
是 额 普林斯吧
It's, um... Prince?

454
00:16:24,662 --> 00:16:26,041
你真说的出口
Lucky guess.

455
00:16:26,143 --> 00:16:27,676
我在烧烤台那里
I was over at the carving station,

456
00:16:27,745 --> 00:16:30,841
我想 你知道谁爱吃牛肋排吗
and I thought, "You know who'd love some prime rib?

457
00:16:30,974 --> 00:16:32,456
是普林斯 布朗校长呢
"Principal Prince Brown."

458
00:16:32,481 --> 00:16:33,738
噢
- Oh. -

459
00:16:33,763 --> 00:16:35,169
马乔里 我担心
Marjorie, I'm afraid

460
00:16:35,194 --> 00:16:37,771
你和我是一场失败配对游戏中的炮灰
you and I are pawns in a very sick game

461
00:16:37,797 --> 00:16:39,464
被这两人撮合的
being orchestrated by these two.

462
00:16:39,566 --> 00:16:41,098
他们非常努力的把我们凑成一对
They're working very hard to put us together,

463
00:16:41,123 --> 00:16:42,333
我不知道为什么
and I don't know why.

464
00:16:42,576 --> 00:16:45,275
我从没看过她们对其他事这么上心
I've never seen them work very hard in anything,

465
