除了想从志愿者活动里开小差之外
except getting out of volunteering.

466
00:16:46,714 --> 00:16:49,939
嘿 公正地讲 我们可自愿做很多事呢
Hey, to be fair, we volunteer for plenty of things.

467
00:16:49,964 --> 00:16:53,564
是的 你不记得我拿着水管洗车吗
Yeah, don't you remember me holding a hose at the car wash?

468
00:16:53,589 --> 00:16:55,814
是的 每个人都记得
Yeah, everybody remembers that.

469
00:16:55,839 --> 00:16:57,681
所以你对我不感兴趣咯
So you're not interested in me?

470
00:16:57,868 --> 00:16:59,820
好吧 我们一直是工作伙伴
Well, we've always had a working relationship,

471
00:16:59,913 --> 00:17:02,800
我想我对你没有过那种想法
and I guess I've just never thought of you in that way.

472
00:17:02,825 --> 00:17:03,957
没把我看成一个女人吗
As a woman?

473
