当我工作时 我屏蔽掉那方面的想法
When I'm at work, I turn off that part of myself.

474
00:17:07,459 --> 00:17:08,791
噢
Oh.

475
00:17:08,893 --> 00:17:10,126
噢
Oh.

476
00:17:10,555 --> 00:17:13,313
啊 现在我兴致勃勃了
Uh, it has turned back on.

477
00:17:14,231 --> 00:17:15,305
- 好吧 - 噢
- Okay. - Oh.

478
00:17:15,330 --> 00:17:17,422
噢 我要去检查那 安全出口
Oh, I'm gonna check the... the fire exits.

479
