and get the money for the instruments up front.

484
00:17:25,314 --> 00:17:27,545
你说的就是和 音乐奇才 这部电影一模一样的剧情吧 
You just described the exact plot of "The Music Man."

485
00:17:27,570 --> 00:17:29,683
- 那会发生什么呢 - 赢得四座托尼奖
- How'd that turn out? - Won four Tonys.

486
00:17:29,914 --> 00:17:31,981
电影里是五座 额
Five. Ugh.

487
00:17:32,050 --> 00:17:33,082
你怎么能容许这发生啊
How could you let this happen?

488
00:17:33,184 --> 00:17:34,617
