I don't know. You were texting me

489
00:17:34,642 --> 00:17:37,004
你就发短信来了 
while I was live streaming my breakfast, and...

490
00:17:37,175 --> 00:17:38,283
等一下
Wait a minute.

491
00:17:38,308 --> 00:17:39,681
我确实说了是800美金吧
I did say $800.

492
00:17:39,706 --> 00:17:40,823
看
Look.

493
00:17:40,892 --> 00:17:42,931
噢 我的天 这全是我的错
Oh, my God, this is all my fault.

494
00:17:42,956 --> 00:17:44,283
好吧 好吧 好吧
Well, well, well.

495
00:17:44,409 --> 00:17:47,393
看起来傻瓜另有其人哦
Looks like the dunce cap is on the other foot.

496
00:17:48,558 --> 00:17:49,574
嘿
Hey!

497
00:17:49,599 --> 00:17:52,542
和你一样体型的动物吃的是什么呢
Is what an animal your size grazes on.

498
00:17:52,567 --> 00:17:53,850
吃的是干草
Hay is...

499
00:17:53,952 --> 00:17:55,085
你胖的像头牛
You're a cow.

500
00:17:56,388 --> 00:17:57,614
好吧
Okay.

501
00:17:58,639 --> 00:18:01,153
你的体重和体型很搭
You're the perfect weight for your frame.

502
00:18:04,972 --> 00:18:05,905
嘿
Hey.

503
00:18:05,930 --> 00:18:07,806
又一个损人的骄傲时刻呢
Another proud moment for the struggle.

504
00:18:07,831 --> 00:18:09,483
额 娘娘腔来了
Ugh. Here she comes.

505
00:18:09,508 --> 00:18:11,578
马丁 卢瑟女王大人 是的
